Krea realtime-video dense autoregressive baseline, migrated into FlagScale.
Upstream: https://github.com/krea-ai/realtime-video
Revision: acf4b7b4e1a3049a0e04782e751d12203334038d (also in provenance.json).
Upstream repository license: CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0, retained in LICENSE.md.
Existing Alibaba Wan copyright notices are retained on the model sources.

causal_inference.py (in the parent diffusion directory) extracts the text-to-video
GenerationSession from release_server.py and its cache allocation methods from
pipeline/causal_inference.py. It preserves the five-step schedule, seeded noise,
context reconstruction, cache resets, boundary reencoding and first-pixel crop.
The websocket server, webcam/video input and training entrypoints are excluded.

This directory contains the independent original dense Wan implementation,
scheduler and inference backbone. All imports are package-relative. The FA2
import fix previously applied by the external adapter is included. The optional
Sage custom op uses a FlagScale-specific namespace. No HorizonKV sparse modules
are imported. causal_vae.py in the parent directory contains the original block-3
streaming VAE (excluding the unused VAEEncoder3d class).
